  "prefLabel": "Per 903.01 Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Per 903.01 Applicability. This part shall apply only to non-exempt employees and any use of the term “employee” in this part shall refer only to non-exempt employees.\n\nSource. #14439, eff 12-1-25, EXPIRES: 12-1-35",
